timate: 950s (actual depends on machine)\n   - Monitoring: Check remaining time every 10 optimization steps\n   - Fallback: Use least-angle projection at all times; for NaNs: hg = h.grad, then project\n\n6. **Validation and Return Contract**\n   - Verify feasibility:\n     ```python\n     assert np.all((h >= 0) & (h <= 1)), \"Bounds violated\"\n     assert abs(sum(h) - n/2.0) < 1e-5, \"Integral constraint failed\"\n     ```\n   - Compute final score via:\n     ```python\n     corr = np.correlate(h, 1-h, mode='full')\n     c_final = np.max(corr)*dx\n     ```\n   - Final post-processing:\n     ```python\n     cdf = compute_cdf(h)  # Cross correlate with self-shifting\n     return h, c_final, n\n     ```",
